{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方大面积、高亮度的白色文字块，绿色竖线强化了入口。右上角目录字小且不抢眼，下半部分音符动画亮度较低，不构成主要竞争。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正和某个人处于亲近相处的状态，暂时不想考虑两个人的未来，只想停留在当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、安静。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实想表达自己有多喜欢这种亲近，也想知道对方是否有同样的感受，但不知道如何开口；内心还有逐渐漂远、犹豫和话语难以表达的状态。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思。\",\n    \"开头的舒服和亲近比较容易拿到，但后面的心思漂远、想表达喜欢却说不出口，需要继续读才能发现。\",\n    \"核心感受存在变化，不能只凭开头判断完整的情绪状态。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b18edcd5-1193-483e-89cd-c2341559b06f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014106724192Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:41:38.459467+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03c70502ef10d8b47a22a48cc394961cd4f3b10e87551e7465aa46bb3d3076e9", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\